31 A1 00 11 EF FD 00 EF 48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 57 6F 72 6C 64 21 00 FF

### This is an example in plaintext, if you want runnable examples check ../raw-elal ###

### Explanation:
31A1: Header
00: Separator
11 EF FD: Print EF and tell print EF is a variable and not an ASCII char using FD
00: Separator
EF 48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 57 6F 72 6C 64 21: Define EF, in this case ASCII for "Hello World!"
00: Separator
FF: EOF
